/58-df-core-model-k.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> (cumulative-hierarchy level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md\">../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\alpha\">\\(K_\\alpha\\)</span> (candidate initial segment)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S\\)</span> (core-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f8f3c414525dd904\" href=\"?note=f8f3c414525dd904\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md\">../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CoreModelInitialSegment}\">\\(\\operatorname{CoreModelInitialSegment}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\operatorname{CoreModelInitialSegment}(K_\\alpha,K,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S(K)\\land K_\\alpha=\\{x\\in V_\\alpha:x\\in K\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\operatorname{CoreModelInitialSegment}(K_\\alpha,K,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S(K)\\land K_\\alpha=\\{x\\in V_\\alpha:x\\in K\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient core model is an explicit definable-class argument rather than an undeclared set constant; bounded separation over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> produces the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\alpha\">\\(K_\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md","status":"resolved","id":"f8f3c414525dd904","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md","status":"resolved","id":"f8f3c414525dd904","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ (core-model class in the ambient definable-class metatheory, see [[../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$ (ordinal, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V_\\alpha$ (cumulative-hierarchy level, see [[../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md","status":"resolved","id":"f8f3c414525dd904","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S$ (core-model predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"K_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CoreModelInitialSegment}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\operatorname{CoreModelInitialSegment}(K_\\alpha,K,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S(K)\\land K_\\alpha=\\{x\\in V_\\alpha:x\\in K\\}","display":true},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"K_\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1370,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1778","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-core-model-initial-segment.md|58-df-zfc-core-model-initial-segment]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["f8f3c414525dd904","19e9a8c33d5c841c","5582a281f15a33c2"]}